   "Atlas/Rudvalis/CoupleCoordinateOrbits.lean:4:0: The module doc-string for a file should be the first command after the imports.\nPlease, add a module doc-string before `theorem couple_coordinate_reference_row_transitive (v w : MinimalCross)\n    (hv : v ∈ coordinateRowFrame (rowLabel 0)) (hw : w ∈ coordinateRowFrame (rowLabel 0))\n    (hvx : v ≠ localReferenceCross) (hvy : v ≠ referenceSecondCross) (hwx : w ≠ localReferenceCross)\n    (hwy : w ≠ referenceSecondCross) : ∃ g : codeCoupleStabilizer, g.val • v = w :=\n  by\n  obtain ⟨x, rfl⟩ := hv\n  obtain ⟨y, rfl⟩ := hw\n  have hx := (coordinate_reference_row_four_cases x).resolve_left hvx |>.resolve_left hvy\n  have hy := (coordinate_reference_row_four_cases y).resolve_left hwx |>.resolve_left hwy\n  let R : codeCoupleStabilizer := ⟨codeR, coupleCodeR_fixes_reference⟩\n  rcases hx with hx | hx <;> rcases hy with hy | hy\n  · exact ⟨1, by simpa only [Subgroup.coe_one, one_smul] using hx.trans hy.symm⟩\n  ·\n    exact\n      ⟨R, by change codeR • coordinateCross (rowLabel 0, x) = coordinateCross (rowLabel 0, y);\n        rw [hx, hy, coupleCodeR_swap_last_two.1]⟩\n  ·\n    exact\n      ⟨R, by change codeR • coordinateCross (rowLabel 0, x) = coordinateCross (rowLabel 0, y);\n        rw [hx, hy, coupleCodeR_swap_last_two.2]⟩\n  · exact ⟨1, by simpa only [Subgroup.coe_one, one_smul] using hx.trans hy.symm⟩`.\n\nNote: This linter can be disabled with `set_option linter.style.header false`",
